h=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/de87182423886aa99350b62b1adc2db9.webm?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/de87182423886aa99350b62b1adc2db9.mp4?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a test subject dispatched into the Backrooms</strong></h2>Async Corporation (aka Backroom Company) is a mysterious organization that explores the Backrooms\u2014spaces accessible through a surreal phenomenon called \u201cNoclip.\u201d <br>No one knows when or by whom the company was founded, and most explorers sent into the Backrooms have <strong>vanished without a trace.</strong><br><br>Now, you will follow in their footsteps and enter the Backrooms. <br>You must collect bizarre items hidden in each room and use your camcorder to <strong>record unexplainable phenomena and creatures.</strong> <br>This data is more than just documentation\u2014it\u2019s <strong>the key to survival.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.poster.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.webm?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.mp4?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This place defies logic</strong></h2>Threats inside the Backrooms defy common sense. <br>Some move incredibly fast and cannot be killed by any means. <br>Your only option may be to hide in a locker and hold your breath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.poster.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.webm?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.mp4?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span><br><br>Other entities are blind but respond instantly to the slightest noise. <br>Every step, every breath must be taken with caution. <br>Silence is your best chance at survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.poster.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.webm?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.mp4?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The truth is drawing near</strong></h2>As you continue your expeditions, strange signs begin to emerge. <br><strong>Blagos</strong>, the middle manager at Backroom Company, constantly sends encouraging messages to explorers\u2014but some have started to suspect the hidden control system behind them.<br><br>What seemed like accidents at first now reveal <strong>repeating patterns and structures.</strong> <br>As you collect more data on phenomena and creatures, you\u2019ll begin to realize this mission may be part of a much bigger experiment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.poster.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.webm?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.mp4?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Warning</strong></h2>There is only one thing left to do: <strong>uncover the true nature of this experiment yourself.</strong> <br>Will you reach the truth\u2014or fall into another trap?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/879a63f54b02c66caf5bacdfb86af22e.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span><br><br><strong>Good luck.</strong> <br>And one last thing\u2014no matter how angry you get, <strong>don\u2019t kill your teammates.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/e497d8612513793ed35c573940bd89a3.poster.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/e497d8612513793ed35c573940bd89a3.webm?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/e497d8612513793ed35c573940bd89a3.mp4?t=1753862334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/61881f8cdac5d6dff78ca589d934b7c2.avif?t=1753862334\" width=600 height=15 /></span>",
